{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04305","headline":"奉和圣制夏日游石淙山 · 薛曜","name":"奉和圣制夏日游石淙山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉洞幽寻更是天，朱霞绿景镇韶年。\n飞花藉藉迷行路，啭鸟遥遥作管弦。\n雾隐长林成翠幄，风吹细雨即虹泉。\n此中碧酒恒参圣，浪道崑山别有仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛曜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04305.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04305","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}